                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 44.—Ex. Doc. No.
                    139.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Forty-seventh Congress, First session,
                        Senate.</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Message from the President of the
                        United States, transmitting, in response to Senate resolution of the 9th
                        instant, a report from the Secretary of State, with accompanying papers,
                        relating to the alleged imprisonment by the British Government of Daniel
                        McSweeney, a citizen of the United States.</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center">(Omitted.)</p>
            </div>
